msgstr "Exploración de escaneo limitado"

#: cookie/class-scan.php:1098
msgid "Upgrade Now"
msgstr "Actualiza ahora"

#: cookie/class-scan.php:1071
msgid "Upgrade to Complianz Premium to enable per-post website scanning."
